{"type":"message","id":"61b24af6","parentId":"1f90d4dd","timestamp":"2026-04-29T11:19:25.388Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool_read_21aEXUVbz92CspTaO4iB","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n<rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\" xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\" xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\">\n  <channel>\n    <title>Cointelegraph.com News</title>\n    <link>https://cointelegraph.com</link>\n    <atom:link href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/rss?_refresh=nm5ymi&amp;cachebust=true\" rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\"/>\n    <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    <generator>cointelegraph.com</generator>\n    <lastBuildDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 10:37:11 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    <language>en</language>\n    <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    <image>\n      <title>Cointelegraph.com News</title>\n      <link>https://cointelegraph.com</link>\n      <url>https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b9ea15d46738b4df64e6e100ab59b373.png</url>\n      <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    </image>\n    <item>\n      <title>Celsius founder Alex Mashinsky settles FTC case with $10M payment</title>\n      <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 10:10:18 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 10:10:18 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/celsius-founder-settlement-includes-10m-payment-suspended-47b-judgment</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/celsius-founder-settlement-includes-10m-payment-suspended-47b-judgment?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLVRoZS1DZWxzaXVzLU5ldHdvcmstQS1wcm91ZC10cmFpbGJsYXplci1mb3ItdGhlLWNyeXB0by1pbmR1c3RyeTQ0LmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" alt=\"Celsius founder Alex Mashinsky settles FTC case with $10M payment\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The FTC order ties Mashinsky’s $10 million payment to a mostly suspended $4.72 billion judgment that can be revived over asset disclosures.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Ezra Reguerra</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLVRoZS1DZWxzaXVzLU5ldHdvcmstQS1wcm91ZC10cmFpbGJsYXplci1mb3ItdGhlLWNyeXB0by1pbmR1c3RyeTQ0LmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLVRoZS1DZWxzaXVzLU5ldHdvcmstQS1wcm91ZC10cmFpbGJsYXplci1mb3ItdGhlLWNyeXB0by1pbmR1c3RyeTQ0LmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Canada proposes crypto ATM ban over scams and money laundering</title>\n      <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 09:49:45 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 09:49:45 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/canada-proposes-crypto-atm-ban-over-scams-and-money-laundering</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/canada-proposes-crypto-atm-ban-over-scams-and-money-laundering?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLVdoYXQtQXJlLUlsbGVnYWwtQml0Y29pbi1BVE1zLWFuZC1Ib3ctdG8tU3RheS1TYWZlMy5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" alt=\"Canada proposes crypto ATM ban over scams and money laundering\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Ottawa says Bitcoin ATMs have become a key tool for scammers, as regulators move to tighten oversight of high-risk parts of the crypto sector.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Christina Comben</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLVdoYXQtQXJlLUlsbGVnYWwtQml0Y29pbi1BVE1zLWFuZC1Ib3ctdG8tU3RheS1TYWZlMy5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLVdoYXQtQXJlLUlsbGVnYWwtQml0Y29pbi1BVE1zLWFuZC1Ib3ctdG8tU3RheS1TYWZlMy5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin, stocks risk 'months' of losses as Kevin Warsh Becomes Fed chair</title>\n      <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 09:19:21 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 09:19:21 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-stocks-face-months-of-losses-as-kevin-warsh-becomes-fed-chair</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-stocks-face-months-of-losses-as-kevin-warsh-becomes-fed-chair?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL3NhZCUyMGJpdGNvaW4lMjBjcnlwdG8lMjByaXZlciUyMDIuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin, stocks risk 'months' of losses as Kevin Warsh Becomes Fed chair\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin fell after each new Federal Reserve chair began work, data showed, while Kevin Warsh gave mixed signals over policy for risk assets.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by William Suberg</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL3NhZCUyMGJpdGNvaW4lMjBjcnlwdG8lMjByaXZlciUyMDIuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL3NhZCUyMGJpdGNvaW4lMjBjcnlwdG8lMjByaXZlciUyMDIuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Polymarket denies data breach, says hacker is selling public data</title>\n      <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 07:10:18 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 07:10:18 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/polymarket-says-hacker-is-selling-publicly-available-data-while-claiming-security-breach</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/polymarket-says-hacker-is-selling-publicly-available-data-while-claiming-security-breach?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL05ld3MlMjBjb2luJTIwbWFuJTIwUG9seW1hcmtldC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" alt=\"Polymarket denies data breach, says hacker is selling public data\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The apparent hacker claimed to have breached other prediction markets and planned to release the data in the next few days.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL05ld3MlMjBjb2luJTIwbWFuJTIwUG9seW1hcmtldC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL05ld3MlMjBjb2luJTIwbWFuJTIwUG9seW1hcmtldC5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Aptos says its new privacy coin seeks to fix one of crypto’s biggest trade-offs</title>\n      <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 06:57:28 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 06:57:28 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/aptos-says-its-new-privacy-coin-prevents-wallet-profiling-targeted-scams</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/aptos-says-its-new-privacy-coin-prevents-wallet-profiling-targeted-scams?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJX1VTJTIwd2VpcmQlMjB1bHRyYXJpZ2h0JTIwY29uc2VydmF0aXZlcyUyMGxvb2slMjBpbnRvJTIwY3J5cHRvJTIwYXMlMjBhbmFyY2hpYyUyMGNpdGFkZWwuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" alt=\"Aptos says its new privacy coin seeks to fix one of crypto’s biggest trade-offs\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Aptos said its new privacy coin could be used to enable businesses to transact onchain without competitors tracking treasury moves and trading strategies. </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJX1VTJTIwd2VpcmQlMjB1bHRyYXJpZ2h0JTIwY29uc2VydmF0aXZlcyUyMGxvb2slMjBpbnRvJTIwY3J5cHRvJTIwYXMlMjBhbmFyY2hpYyUyMGNpdGFkZWwuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJX1VTJTIwd2VpcmQlMjB1bHRyYXJpZ2h0JTIwY29uc2VydmF0aXZlcyUyMGxvb2slMjBpbnRvJTIwY3J5cHRvJTIwYXMlMjBhbmFyY2hpYyUyMGNpdGFkZWwuanBnP3ByZWZpeD1tZWRpYSUyRmFydGljbGUtY292ZXJz.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>CFTC pulls Wisconsin into fight over prediction market jurisdiction</title>\n      <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 05:27:05 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 05:27:05 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/cftc-sues-wisconsin-over-prediction-markets</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/cftc-sues-wisconsin-over-prediction-markets?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwTGF3bWFrZXJzJTIwQmlhcyUyQ