{"type":"message","id":"867dc95a","parentId":"df16eac5","timestamp":"2026-04-29T11:19:31.976Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool_read_5MLkc1vXfCnwyvt3m1jc","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?>\n<rss\n  version=\"2.0\"\n  xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\"\n  xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\"\n  xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n  xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\"\n  xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\"\n  xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\"\n  xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\"\n  xmlns:snf=\"http://www.smartnews.be/snf\"\n>\n  <channel>\n    <title>Decrypt</title>\n    <description>What&amp;#039;s new in crypto and the advent of the decentralized web.</description>\n    <language>en</language>\n    \n    <atom:link\n      href=\"https://decrypt.co/feed\"\n      rel=\"self\"\n      type=\"application/rss+xml\"\n    />\n    \n    \n      \n        <link>https://decrypt.co/feed</link>\n      \n    \n    \n      <copyright>Decrypt Media</copyright>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <lastBuildDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 09:55:18 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Judge Shoots Down Sam Bankman-Fried&#39;s Bid for New Trial</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365915/judge-shoots-down-sam-bankman-frieds-bid-for-new-trial</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 09:55:18 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The judge dismissed the FTX founder’s claims that potential witnesses faced &#34;government threats and retaliation&#34; as &#34;wildly conspiratorial.”</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365915</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sam-bankman-fried-ftx-sbf-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sam-bankman-fried-ftx-sbf-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>AI Agent Deletes Startup’s Database in 9 Seconds, Founder Says</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365897/ai-agent-deletes-startup-database-9-seconds-founder-says</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 23:00:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>PocketOS founder Jeremy Crane claims a Cursor agent running Claude Opus wiped production data and backups through a single Railway API call.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365897</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/robot-typing-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/robot-typing-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Woman Gets 71 Months in Prison Over Bitcoin Investment Fraud Targeting Elderly Victims</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365894/woman-71-months-prison-bitcoin-investment-fraud-targeting-elderly-victims</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 22:01:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Federal prosecutors secured a prison term for a Saipan woman who defrauded elderly victims through a fake Bitcoin investment scheme</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365894</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Jail-cell-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Jail-cell-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenClaw Insider Builds the Enterprise Safety Layer the Project Never Shipped</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365888/red-hat-tank-os-openclaw-enterprise-security</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 21:46:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Red Hat principal engineer and OpenClaw maintainer Sally O&#39;Malley released Tank OS—a tool that sandboxes AI agents in isolated containers, keeping credentials locked and agents from interfering with each other or the host machine.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365888</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/OpenClaw2-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/OpenClaw2-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"899\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>CFTC Backs Prediction Markets in Yet Another Lawsuit Against a State</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365889/cftc-prediction-markets-lawsuit-wisconsin</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 21:21:51 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>CFTC Chair Mike Selig has vowed to sue any state that attempts to regulate prediction markets under its own gambling laws. </description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Sander Lutz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365889</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cftc-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cftc-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Dead Internet? A Third of New Websites Are AI-Generated, Says Stanford</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365864/one-third-new-websites-ai-generated-study</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 20:32:26 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A Stanford-led study quantified what everyone already suspected—but the findings aren&#39;t quite what people expected.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365864</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-07-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-07-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Robinhood Shares Slide on 34% Decrease in Crypto Revenue</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365876/robinhood-shares-slide-34-decrease-crypto-revenue</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 20:26:00 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Retail brokerage Robinhood&#39;s business has gotten a boost from prediction markets, though its crypto trading revenue fell in Q1.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365876</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/robinhood-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/robinhood-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Google DeepMind Veteran Raises $1.1 Billion to Build AI That Isn’t Trained With Human Data</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365853/google-deepmind-veteran-raises-1-1-billion-ai-isnt-trained-human-data</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 20:13:48 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Ineffable Intelligence is betting that reinforcement learning is the path to superintelligence, rather than AI&#39;s large language models.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365853</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/decrypt-style-brain-hand-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/decrypt-style-brain-hand-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Soldier Charged in Polymarket Insider Trading Case Pleads Not Guilty</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365858/soldier-charged-polymarket-insider-trading-case-pleads-not-guilty</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 19:21:17 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Special forces member Gannon Ken Van Dyke allegedly used inside knowledge of a Venezuelan military operation to make nearly $400K profit on Polymarket.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365858</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/crime_jail-handcuffs-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/crime_jail-handcuffs-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Google Signs AI Deal With Pentagon for Classified Work as Employees Object</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365857/google-ai-deal-pentagon-classified-work</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 19:13:30 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Google faces internal backlash as it signs a Pentagon AI deal for classified military work.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365857</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/google-decrypt-style-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/google-decrypt-style-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>IREN Price Target Cut as Bernstein Sees Firm Dumping Bitcoin Mining for AI</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365852/iren-price-target-cut-as-bernstein-sees-firm-dumping-bitcoin-mining-for-ai</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 18:09:08 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Bernstein analysts see IREN’s AI cloud prospects growing substantially in the coming years—and its Bitcoin business disappearing entirely.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365852</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/bitcoin-mining-decrypt-style-03-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/bitcoin-mining-decrypt-style-03-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Aave, Compound Unveil Technical Plan to Address Fallout From $290M Kelp DAO Hack</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365847/aave-compound-unveil-technical-plan-to-address-fallout-from-290m-kelp-dao-hack</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 17:36:01 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Major DeFi protocols outlined technical steps to eliminate bad debt and restore full backing for exploited rsETH tokens.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365847</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/aave-up-decrypt-style-scaled-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>compound-governance-token</category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>DeFi</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/aave-up-decrypt-style-scaled-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1441\" width=\"2560\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Stablecoin Giant Tether Reveals Plans for Modular Bitcoin Mining Hardware</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365840/stablecoin-giant-tether-modular-bitcoin-mining-hardware</link>\n  <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 16:50:38 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Leading stablecoin issuer Tether has teamed with Canaan and ACME Swisstech to develop customizable, upgradable Bitcoin mining rigs.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365840</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/bitcoin-mining-decrypt-style-04-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/bitcoin-mining-decrypt-style-04-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Inside Trump’s Meme Coin Bash: Foreign Guests, Iran War Riffs, and Mar-a-Lago Charm</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365830/inside-trump-meme-coin-bash-foreign-guests-iran-war-mar-a-